{"id":"71962c0a446ff8b2","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-smullyan-solovay-completeness.md","title":"Solovay Completeness for Standard P.A. Provability","display":"thm-smullyan-solovay-completeness — Solovay Completeness for Standard P.A. Provability","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-smullyan-solovay-completeness","aliases":["92-thm-smullyan-solovay-completeness"],"display":"thm-smullyan-solovay-completeness — Solovay Completeness for Standard P.A. Provability","source":"第 XI 章 p. 134（PDF 151）；原书引 Boolos [1979] 为完整证明来源","source_status":"原书引用的定理；完整外部证明未重建","depends_on":["[[92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization]]","[[92-df-modal-k-k4-g]]","[[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-smullyan-solovay-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-smullyan-solovay-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-smullyan-solovay-completeness — Solovay Completeness for Standard P.A. Provability"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 p. 134（PDF 151）；原书引 Boolos [1979] 为完整证明来源"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书引用的定理；完整外部证明未重建"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2cf611da381080e0\" href=\"?note=2cf611da381080e0\" title=\"92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization\">92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e69e849d9714457a\" href=\"?note=e69e849d9714457a\" title=\"92-df-modal-k-k4-g\">92-df-modal-k-k4-g</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7a63648901cbcd33\" href=\"?note=7a63648901cbcd33\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-proof-code\">92-df-smullyan-proof-code</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}_A\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}_A\\)</span> 是原书 P.A. 演算。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(U_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 专指第 IX 章 pp. 106–107 从通常 P.A. 有限证明检查构成的标准可证性谓词，固定原书编号及通常算术化呈现；不是任意语义等价或任意满足 P1–P3 的公式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_\\rho^{U_{\\mathrm{PA}}}\">\\(\\alpha_\\rho^{U_{\\mathrm{PA}}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2cf611da381080e0\" href=\"?note=2cf611da381080e0\" title=\"92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization\">92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\vdash F\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\rho:\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_A\\;\n\\mathrm{PA}_A\\vdash\\alpha_\\rho^{U_{\\mathrm{PA}}}(F)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\vdash F\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\rho:\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_A\\;\n\\mathrm{PA}_A\\vdash\\alpha_\\rho^{U_{\\mathrm{PA}}}(F)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书陈述双向结果：正向是标准 PA 可证性对 G 的解释可靠性，逆向是 Solovay 完备性。完整逆向证明被引用至 Boolos, The Unprovability of Consistency (1979)；该外部书未在本任务中读到，没有重建 Solovay 函数或机器证明。</p>\n<p>前提固定通常 proof-verification 的强度与呈现；只有 P1–P3 或数码正确性不能在本节点代替这一标准选择。须取遍所有算术句子赋值，单个 realization 可证不够。本节点记录原书确实收录的陈述及其适用范围。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization","status":"resolved","id":"2cf611da381080e0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-modal-k-k4-g","status":"resolved","id":"e69e849d9714457a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-k-k4-g]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-proof-code","status":"resolved","id":"7a63648901cbcd33","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization","status":"resolved","id":"2cf611da381080e0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$；$\\alpha_\\rho^{U_{\\mathrm{PA}}}$ 见 [[92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}_A","display":false},{"tex":"U_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha_\\rho^{U_{\\mathrm{PA}}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}solovay\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n\\left[\n\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\vdash F\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\rho:\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_A\\;\n\\mathrm{PA}_A\\vdash\\alpha_\\rho^{U_{\\mathrm{PA}}}(F)\n\\right].","display":true}],"bytes":1883,"backlinks":[{"id":"bf4e24a615d3695e","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-k-k4-g]]、[[92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-solovay-completeness]]"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-125","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-abstract-translation]] → [[92-thm-modal-translation-soundness]]；[[92-df-modal-ari